{"id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","title":"Smooth Covariant Tensor and Exterior Derivative Data","display":"df-smooth-tensor-data — Smooth Covariant Tensor and Exterior Derivative Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-smooth-tensor-data","aliases":["58-df-smooth-tensor-data"],"display":"df-smooth-tensor-data — Smooth Covariant Tensor and Exterior Derivative Data","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-smooth-tensor-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-smooth-tensor-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smooth-tensor-data — Smooth Covariant Tensor and Exterior Derivative Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8a29fc853b841c25\" href=\"?note=8a29fc853b841c25\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md\">../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>流形记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}\\)</span> 由下式定义。所有显式带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的关系均从当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 投影这些分量；记录格式错误时关系为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(S)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\">\\(C(S)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(S,p)=T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\">\\(T(S,p)=T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak X(S)=\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\">\\(\\mathfrak X(S)=\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\)</span>。这些缩写只在合法流形记录域使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a v+b w=\\{\\langle f,av(f)+bw(f)\\rangle:f\\in C(S)\\}\">\\(a v+b w=\\{\\langle f,av(f)+bw(f)\\rangle:f\\in C(S)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{S,p}=\\{\\langle f,0\\rangle:f\\in C(S)\\}\">\\(0_{S,p}=\\{\\langle f,0\\rangle:f\\in C(S)\\}\\)</span>；切向量加法及有限和均逐点计算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[i\\mapsto v]\">\\(s[i\\mapsto v]\\)</span> 是有限函数的单项更新。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的定义域为有限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq r\">\\(I\\subseteq r\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{del}_{58}(s,I)=s\\circ e_{r,I}\">\\(\\operatorname{del}_{58}(s,I)=s\\circ e_{r,I}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_{r,I}=\\{\\langle|j\\setminus I|,j\\rangle:j\\in r\\setminus I\\}\">\\(e_{r,I}=\\{\\langle|j\\setminus I|,j\\rangle:j\\in r\\setminus I\\}\\)</span>；该定义保留未删项的原次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>零阶协变张量以实数表示，正阶以多线性函数图表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(t,v,0)=t\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(t,v,0)=t\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&gt;0\">\\(r&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in T(S,p)^r\">\\(v\\in T(S,p)^r\\)</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(t,v,r)=t(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(t,v,r)=t(v)\\)</span>。多元应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1})\">\\(t(v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1})\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1}\\rangle)\">\\(t(\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1}\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta[X]\">\\(\\eta[X]\\)</span> 在下式定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X_i,X_j]\">\\([X_i,X_j]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_i[f]\">\\(X_i[f]\\)</span> 使用指定流形结构上的向量场函数图，不是未定义的几何算子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}\">\\(\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\;\\bigl(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\;\\bigl(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}_{58}(t,S,p,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land p\\in M\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\bigl[(r=0\\land t\\in\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(r&gt;0\\land t\\in\\mathbb R^{T(S,p)^r}\n\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)^r\\;\\forall i&lt;r\\;\\forall u,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}t(v[i\\mapsto au+bw])=a\\,t(v[i\\mapsto u])+b\\,t(v[i\\mapsto w]))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}_{58}(t,S,p,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land p\\in M\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\bigl[(r=0\\land t\\in\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(r&gt;0\\land t\\in\\mathbb R^{T(S,p)^r}\n\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)^r\\;\\forall i&lt;r\\;\\forall u,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}t(v[i\\mapsto au+bw])=a\\,t(v[i\\mapsto u])+b\\,t(v[i\\mapsto w]))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R\\cup\\mathbb R^{T(S,p)^r}:\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}_{58}(t,S,p,r)\\},\\\\\n\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\right)^M\n\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^r\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\eta(p)\\in\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\to\n\\eta[X]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(\\eta(p),\\langle X(i)(p):i&lt;r\\rangle,r)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R\\cup\\mathbb R^{T(S,p)^r}:\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}_{58}(t,S,p,r)\\},\\\\\n\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\right)^M\n\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^r\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\eta(p)\\in\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\to\n\\eta[X]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(\\eta(p),\\langle X(i)(p):i&lt;r\\rangle,r)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\right)^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\eta(p)\\in\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^r\\;\\eta[X]\\in C(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\right)^M\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\eta(p)\\in\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^r\\;\\eta[X]\\in C(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\land\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)^r\\;\\forall i,j&lt;r\\;\n(i&lt;j\\land v(i)=v(j)\\to\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(\\eta(p),v,r)=0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\land\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)^r\\;\\forall i,j&lt;r\\;\n(i&lt;j\\land v(i)=v(j)\\to\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(\\eta(p),v,r)=0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\land\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\theta,S,r+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^{r+1}\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta[X](p)=\\sum_{i&lt;r+1}(-1)^i X(i)[\\eta[\\operatorname{del}_{58}(X,\\{i\\})]](p)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}+\\sum_{i&lt;j&lt;r+1}(-1)^{i+j}\n\\eta[\\langle[X(i),X(j)]\\rangle^\\frown\\operatorname{del}_{58}(X,\\{i,j\\})](p)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\land\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\theta,S,r+1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^{r+1}\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta[X](p)=\\sum_{i&lt;r+1}(-1)^i X(i)[\\eta[\\operatorname{del}_{58}(X,\\{i\\})]](p)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12mm}+\\sum_{i&lt;j&lt;r+1}(-1)^{i+j}\n\\eta[\\langle[X(i),X(j)]\\rangle^\\frown\\operatorname{del}_{58}(X,\\{i,j\\})](p)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(g,S,2)\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;g(p)(v,w)=g(p)(w,v)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;(v\\ne0_{S,p}\\to g(p)(v,v)&gt;0).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(g,S,2)\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;g(p)(v,w)=g(p)(w,v)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;(v\\ne0_{S,p}\\to g(p)(v,v)&gt;0).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以切导子上的多线性函数图编码协变张量；光滑性由对全局光滑向量场的求值刻画。外微分由完整的方向导数与 Lie 括号公式定义，零阶和高于维数的次数均有明确意义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"8a29fc853b841c25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-vector-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aec613831b7dd67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C(S)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"T(S,p)=T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak X(S)=\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)","display":false},{"tex":"a v+b w=\\{\\langle f,av(f)+bw(f)\\rangle:f\\in C(S)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0_{S,p}=\\{\\langle f,0\\rangle:f\\in C(S)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s[i\\mapsto v]","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{del}_{58}(s,I)=s\\circ e_{r,I}","display":false},{"tex":"e_{r,I}=\\{\\langle|j\\setminus I|,j\\rangle:j\\in r\\setminus I\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(t,v,0)=t","display":false},{"tex":"r>0","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in T(S,p)^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(t,v,r)=t(v)","display":false},{"tex":"t(v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1})","display":false},{"tex":"t(\\langle v_0,\\ldots,v_{r-1}\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta[X]","display":false},{"tex":"[X_i,X_j]","display":false},{"tex":"X_i[f]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\;\\bigl(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\n\\land\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}_{58}(t,S,p,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land p\\in M\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\bigl[(r=0\\land t\\in\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&\\lor(r>0\\land t\\in\\mathbb R^{T(S,p)^r}\n\\land\\forall v\\in T(S,p)^r\\;\\forall i<r\\;\\forall u,w\\in T(S,p)\\;\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}t(v[i\\mapsto au+bw])=a\\,t(v[i\\mapsto u])+b\\,t(v[i\\mapsto w]))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\coloneqq\n\\{t\\in\\mathbb R\\cup\\mathbb R^{T(S,p)^r}:\\mathrm{MultilinearTangent}_{58}(t,S,p,r)\\},\\\\\n\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\right)^M\n\\land X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^r\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\eta(p)\\in\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\to\n\\eta[X]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(\\eta(p),\\langle X(i)(p):i<r\\rangle,r)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}_{58}(S)\\land r\\in\\omega\n\\land\\eta\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\\right)^M\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\eta(p)\\in\\mathrm{TensorFiber}_{58}(S,p,r)\n\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^r\\;\\eta[X]\\in C(S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\land\n\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)^r\\;\\forall i,j<r\\;\n(i<j\\land v(i)=v(j)\\to\\mathrm{ev}_{58}(\\eta(p),v,r)=0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExteriorDerivativeData}_{58}(\\theta,\\eta,S,r)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\eta,S,r)\\land\\mathrm{DifferentialFormData}_{58}(\\theta,S,r+1)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathfrak X(S)^{r+1}\\;\\forall p\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\theta[X](p)=\\sum_{i<r+1}(-1)^i X(i)[\\eta[\\operatorname{del}_{58}(X,\\{i\\})]](p)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12mm}+\\sum_{i<j<r+1}(-1)^{i+j}\n\\eta[\\langle[X(i),X(j)]\\rangle^\\frown\\operatorname{del}_{58}(X,\\{i,j\\})](p)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}_{58}(g,S,2)\n\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v,w\\in T(S,p)\\;g(p)(v,w)=g(p)(w,v)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\forall v\\in T(S,p)\\;(v\\ne0_{S,p}\\to g(p)(v,v)>0).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4692,"backlinks":[{"id":"c800033782eba35e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"2c7d1de20e312049","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"efe8e2f202483a88","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"d7bfcf5788937844","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"db62358c2ba471b0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"297834c6f058cefe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e548027ea9dbef59","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f810bf542334e0d1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"0b88ba4114f012c8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothManifoldRecord}$、$\\mathrm{SmoothTensorData}$ 取 [[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md|58-df-smooth-tensor-data]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["8a29fc853b841c25","4aec613831b7dd67","d87c5d842ade903d","36d7463d215be751"]}